<text><body>
<div type="detail"><p>The Migrant Women’s Refuge opened in 1978 to provide emergency accommodation for migrant women and their children. It was the first refuge in Australia to meet the specific needs of migrant women experiencing domestic violence.  It is still in operation today.</p>
<p><hi rend="italic">Later known as</hi>: Kara House</p></div>
